<title>UK: London offshore tea auction offerings.</title>
<headline>London offshore tea auction offerings.</headline>
<text>
<p>Offshore offering for the Mar 24 London Tea Auction Totalled 5,600 packages of 53.50 kgs. No information was available on the offering for April 7 as the catalogues close on April 2.</p>
<p>							Mar 24</p>
<p>Kenya O/Sh Pkgs	    CIF   Offshore	 200</p>
<p>Malawi O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore	 800</p>
<p>Zimba. O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore     4,600</p>
<p>Apr 7 landed packages already listed totalled 5,366.</p>
</text>
